//Papers on Desk
"Founders_Cube_Papers" "<span align=center>Trivia Questions I Need to Work into a Conversation:</span><br><br>- Who used the pen names Acton, Ellis and Currer Bell?<br>- With what sport did the word 'stymie' originate?<br>- What is the Canadian equivalent of the Emmy?<br>- Where in ancient Rome would one find a frigidarium?<br>- How long does a nanosecond last?<br>- How did the tarantula get its name?<br>- What do the initials M.G. stand for on the famous British automobile?<br>- What do the surnames Aguila and Adler have in common?<br>- What is the highest ranking given to a diamond?<br>- How many knights would fit around King Arthur's table?<br>"

