//Gaspee Neighborhood Plaque
"GaspeePlaque" "Positron discovered residual fractal energy from Professor Xaos' Mandelbrot Device at this location. The fractal energy was cascading off of the main hyperbolic components. Luckily, Positron was able to neutralize the energy before it became dangerous to the public."

//Blank Plaque
"BlankPlaque" "The words on this plaque have been faded away over the years and covered with a delicate patina of foul-smelling white."
